  "description": "Out-of-repo provider test harness for vouchfx step providers. Drives a single-step .e2e.yaml end to end (schema-validate → parse → AST → bind → validate → emit → compile-once → run-isolated) so a provider author can prove a custom provider works against the published engine. TESTING SURFACE — depends on the versioned-not-frozen engine assemblies; the frozen v1 provider contract is Vouchfx.Sdk.",
